 a foreign key to users, so each User has at most one of each.&#10;&#10;- submissions.user_id is nullable (it was added after the table), so a Submission has 0..1 owner.&#10;&#10;- User.role holds an AccountRole name; schema.sql checks it is STUDENT, ADVISOR or ALUMNI.&#10;&#10;- Every foreign key is ON DELETE CASCADE.&#10;&#10;- Course has no associations; schema.sql creates and seeds the courses table.&#10;&#10;- Arrowheads show navigability: only User -&gt; Submission is mapped in both directions." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#fff9db;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1720" width="420" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v128" value="«entity» submissions&#10;Submission" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=44;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#e8dcc0;swimlaneFillColor=#fbf8f0;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="530" y="1720" width="330" height="212" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v129" value="- id: Long  {PK, identity}&#10;- gpa: BigDecimal&#10;- completedCourses: String&#10;- major: String&#10;- careerGoal: String&#10;- createdAt: OffsetDateTime  {@PrePersist}&#10;- user: User  {@JsonIgnore}" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;html=0;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="v128"><mxGeometry x="0" y="44" width="330" height="113" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v130" value="" style="line;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=-1;spacingLeft=3;spacingRight=3;rotatable=0;labelPosition=right;points=[];portConstraint=eastwest;" vertex="1" parent="v128"><mxGeometry x="0" y="157" width="330" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v131" value="+ i